 *   this.title, this.author, this.isAvailable (starts true)
 *
 * Library: constructor(name)
 *   this.name, this._books (empty array)
 *   add(book) - adds a Book to the collection
 *   checkout(title) - sets the first matching available book to unavailable, returns true/false
 *   returnBook(title) - sets the first matching unavailable book to available, returns true/false
 *   get available() - returns array of titles of available books
 */
